Created from [VS Code](https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/copilot/copilot-coding-agent).

`updateCalculations()` unconditionally called `generateNarrative()` on every scoring/time/organization/qualitative change, silently overwriting any custom clinical wording the user had typed into the textarea.

## Changes

- **Edit guard** — `generateNarrative()` is now gated behind a `narrativeManuallyEdited` flag; auto-generation is skipped once the user has typed in the textarea
- **Textarea `input` listener** — Sets the flag and surfaces a visual "Manually edited" amber badge as soon as the user modifies the narrative
- **"↺ Regenerate" button** — Explicit control to reset the flag and re-run auto-generation, overwriting custom text only on demand
- **`resetScoring()` integration** — Full scoring reset also clears the flag and badge so the workflow starts clean

```js
// Before: always overwrites
generateNarrative(copySum, recallSum, copyOrg, recallOrg, pct, cTime, rTime);

// After: only auto-generates when no manual edits exist
if (!narrativeManuallyEdited) {
    generateNarrative(copySum, recallSum, copyOrg, recallOrg, pct, cTime, rTime);
}
```
